talk about, I love that.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.460
- Well and I feel like for
people who may not know,

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.800
I have a podcast, it's called
"Mayim Bialik's Breakdown"

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.950
and I host it with my
partner, Jonathan Cohen

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.570
