00:00:51.119 --> 00:00:54.660
- Well and we ended up
talking a lot about body image

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:55.980
and how we present ourselves

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.920
and I have a tremendous
amount of anxiety about that

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:00.320
and a lot of respect for the
way that you present yourself,

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.940
