00:01:03.257 --> 00:01:05.046
"What would Kelly Clarkson tell you?"

00:01:05.046 --> 00:01:05.879
(audience laughs)

00:01:05.879 --> 00:01:06.760
- No, it is true though.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:08.280
I love that about the podcast,

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.840
