talking about everything,

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:20.440
it's a very comfortable
and fun environment

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:23.660
and also for people that maybe
don't know that side of me

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.900
or that part of me that I
don't talk about anywhere else,

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:26.733
I thought it was really cool.

00:01:26.733 --> 00:01:28.947
- Well and that's what a
lot of our guests say, like,

00:01:28.947 --> 00:01:30.577
"Gosh! I've never shared this before,"

00:01:30.577 --> 00:01:32.100
"I've never talked about this before"

