00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:39.923
and he was like, "No." (laughs)

00:01:39.923 --> 00:01:41.177
- Oh my god, I love you, what?

00:01:41.177 --> 00:01:43.690
- And I was like, "Well, my
pebbles isn't from Texas"

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:44.880
